{"body":{"matters":"time horizon of the objective","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100043X"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100046H"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100048P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004BS"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004C1"}],"prose":"Effective holons weigh consequences beyond the goal at hand, which forces a question of how effect is ever measured.","title":"The long horizon against the quick win"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007E","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the structure that makes data interpretable","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10000CA"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004EW"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004H6"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PK"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004PV"}],"prose":"Understanding holons turn mixed data into situational knowledge through ontologies and inference, at the cost of building and keeping those ontologies.","title":"Meaning built from structure"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007F","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
