{"body":{"matters":"the direction of flow among roles","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005D3"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005EF"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005FG"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005GB"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10005J3"}],"prose":"Checks flow into the effective holon, understanding feeds both, and vigilance spans all layers; the roles form a small holarchy of their own.","title":"How the roles feed one another"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007H","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
{"body":{"matters":"the recurring scene","parts":[{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G1000134"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004K9"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10004NP"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100058D"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100059P"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10006GM"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G10007ZY"},{"$holds":true,"$ref":"1M6YBY3G100083H"}],"prose":"Hospitals, disasters, cities and roads recur under nearly every role, so the examples act as shared ground the roles are tried on.","title":"Scenes that travel between roles"},"id":"1M6YBY3G200007J","instance":["1M6YBY3G000000K"]}
